description "167th Assault Squad Officer

^2Weaponry:
- DL-44 Blaster Pistol (3)
- 1 Sonic Detonator
- 3 Thermal Grenades
-- Pushes/slows on hit

^6Inventory:
- Medpac ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Close Combat Training (3)
- Rally

^3Abilities:
- Reserve Ammunition [Press Use on Allies]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]

The 167th Assault Squadron was assigned to the Millennium Falcon for her mission to Gall. Having served valiantly in the Battle of Hoth, the troops are glad that Gall is a temperate planet."